{title: 194 Vive en mí}
{key: D}
{time: 6/4}
{lyricist: Edwin Hatch (1835-1889); Vers. esp.: Edwin l. Mayer (1939-}
{composer: Baylus Benjamim McKinney (1886-1952)}

{sov}
[D]Vive[G], Santo Es[A]píritu,
[D]en este[G] po[D]bre[A] ser;
[D]y que tu[G] fuego[D] celestial
[F#m]transforme mi exis[A7]tir[D].
